y: 'fetchProducts'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","ArrayExpression",["196"],"'handleFileChange' is assigned a value but never used.","'roles' is assigned a value but never used.","'navigate' is assigned a value but never used.","'loading_cer' is assigned a value but never used.","'setLoadingCer' is assigned a value but never used.","'productTechnologies' is assigned a value but never used.","'loadingCountries' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'authState.idToken.claims.email', 'fetchCertificates', 'fetchClientName', 'fetchProductTechnologies', and 'fetchReports'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["197"],"'handleFrequencyChange' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleProductManagerChange' is assigned a value but never used.","'response' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"198","fix":"199"},{"desc":"200","fix":"201"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [clientId, fetchProducts, navigate]",{"range":"202","text":"203"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [formData.productId, authState.idToken.claims?.sub, fetchReports, fetchCertificates, authState.idToken.claims.email, fetchProductTechnologies, fetchClientName]",{"range":"204","text":"205"},[1187,1207],"[clientId, fetchProducts, navigate]",[3314,3367],"[formData.productId, authState.idToken.claims?.sub, fetchReports, fetchCertificates, authState.idToken.claims.email, fetchProductTechnologies, fetchClientName]"]